The cups is a list of 6 zeros, while the poured is 2.
Set item 0 of cups to 20000.
For every row from 0 to 0.
The base is (row times (row plus 1)) divided by 2.
The below is ((row plus 1) times (row plus 2)) divided by 2.
For every glass from 0 to row.
The cell is base plus glass.
The extra is item cell of cups minus 10000.
If extra is more than 0.
The half is extra divided by 2.
The leftchild is below plus glass.
The rightchild is leftchild plus 1.
Set item leftchild of cups to item leftchild of cups plus half.
Set item rightchild of cups to item rightchild of cups plus half.

The target is 2.
The value is item target of cups.
The whole is value divided by 10000, while the part is value modulo 10000.
The rendered is format whole number whole as text.
The digits is empty text.
The thousand is part divided by 1000.
Place format whole number thousand as text into digits.
The hundred is (part divided by 100) modulo 10.
Place format whole number hundred as text into digits.
The ten is (part divided by 10) modulo 10.
Place format whole number ten as text into digits.
The one is part modulo 10.
Place format whole number one as text into digits.
The cut is 4.
Repeat while cut is more than 1.
The look is cut minus 1.
If character look of digits is not "0", stop.
Subtract 1 from cut.

The shown is the slice of digits from 0 to cut.
Place "." into rendered.
Place shown into rendered.
If part is 0, show format whole number whole as text.
If part is more than 0, show rendered.
